[00:27.82]1. Please judge me, Lord, observe my loyalty;
[00:35.78]Observe my trust in you and my integrity.
[00:44.74]Examine me, and put me to the test;
[00:52.34]My mind and heart refine, that my soul might be blessed.
[01:03.26](Chorus)
[01:03.74]But as for me, Determined I will be
[01:10.46]to walk eternally In my integrity.
[01:25.56]2. I do not sit with wicked men of lies.
[01:33.32]I hate the company of those who truth despise.
[01:42.40]Jehovah, please, don’t take away my life
[01:49.96]With men who take delight in bribery and strife.
[02:01.12](Chorus)
[02:01.54]But as for me, Determined I will be
[02:08.12]to walk eternally In my integrity.
[02:21.18]3. For I have loved the dwelling of your house.
[02:29.40]Your worship, oh, so pure, I daily will espouse.
[02:29.70]And I will march around your altar grand,
[02:29.80]To make thanksgiving heard aloud throughout the land.
[02:29.80](Chorus)
[02:45.98]But as for me, Determined I will be
[03:10.72]to walk eternally In my integrity.
